<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia steady at 1.8620 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia steady at 1.8620 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia was unchanged at 1.8620</p>
<p>per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange.</p>
<p>					  April 3	    April 2</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8620	     1.8620</p>
<p> Volume traded			$17.36 million	 $14.50 million</p>
